<h4>How long are your contracts?</h4>
<p>After your free trial period is done, we will charge you on monthly basis.</p>

<h4>How do I sign up?</h4>
<p>By clicking on any of the links above you will start your 45 day trial. After that period you will be reminded to put in your credit card information and we'll start charging you.</p>

<h4>I want to switch plans. Can I do it?</h4>
<p>You can switch your plans at any time. If you have more hubs than the plan permits, we'll archive some of them and you won't lose any data. If you want to start using them later on, upgrade your plan, and start collecting your data again (Archived hubs are not publicly accessible and they don't collect the data).</p>
